    "locked": false,
    "maintainer_can_modify": true,
    "title": "kernel: add wtxid accessor",
    "user": {
      "login": "KY-U",
      "id": 90665609,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjkwNjY1NjA5",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90665609?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/KY-U",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/following%7B/other_user%7D",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/gists%7B/gist_id%7D",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KY-U/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "\r\nWhile the kernel API provides access to a transactions's txid, it does not expose its wtxid. Clients therefore have to hash the transaction's witness serialization themselves, even though `CTransaction` already calculates and caches this value in `m_witness_hash`.\r\n\r\nExpose the wtxid through a C API handle and corresponding C++ view and owning wrappers. Mirror the existing txid operations for copying, destruction, comparison and byte serialization.\r\n\r\nAlso expose `CTransaction::HasWitness()`, allowing clients to determine whether a transaction contains witness data without having to inspect each input themselves.\r\n\r\nTests cover legacy transactions, where txid and wtxid bytes match, and witness transactions, where they differ.\r\n",
    "labels": [
